The public DHCP types and legacy conversion behavior originate from:
  imksoo/routerd
  https://github.com/imksoo/routerd
  commit 1329ef54f296507eda79bbbc3b853783dd27251e

The DHCP server wire/state engine is a new BSD-3-Clause implementation.
The tests use the original public DHCP client message helpers.
No dnsmasq, Kea or ISC DHCP code is embedded.

